    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall fast. Get up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doorway 2 is a high-speed parkour platformer built for momentum, precision, and competition. Jump, slide, and crawl through chaotic, ever-changing obstacle rooms in a surreal world. Run solo or compete with others in multiplayer\u2014every second counts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a jump? No sweat. You\u2019ll respawn at the start of the last room you entered. No full resets, just fast retries that keep you in the flow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique boss arenas, time-based challenges, and movement-focused design, Doorway 2 is all about pushing your limits without ever hitting pause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Parkour-Driven Movement \u2013 Leap gaps, slide under hazards, and crawl through tight spots in tightly designed obstacle maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room-Based Respawns \u2013 Fall, fail, restart in the previous room and keep your run going. No full resets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and Multiplayer Modes \u2013 Run solo or race your friends online for the best time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct Boss Encounters \u2013 Avoid deadly bosses that disrupt movement mid-run, each tied to unique map mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed-Focused Design \u2013 Timer-based gameplay and online leaderboards challenge you to master every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized Worlds \u2013 Dive into a series of surreal, atmospheric environments, each with its own visual identity and flow. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall fast. Get up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doorway 2 is a high-speed parkour platformer built for momentum, precision, and competition. Jump, slide, and crawl through chaotic, ever-changing obstacle rooms in a surreal world. Run solo or compete with others in multiplayer\u2014every second counts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a jump? No sweat. You\u2019ll respawn at the start of the last room you entered. No full resets, just fast retries that keep you in the flow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique boss arenas, time-based challenges, and movement-focused design, Doorway 2 is all about pushing your limits without ever hitting pause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Parkour-Driven Movement \u2013 Leap gaps, slide under hazards, and crawl through tight spots in tightly designed obstacle maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room-Based Respawns \u2013 Fall, fail, restart in the previous room and keep your run going. No full resets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and Multiplayer Modes \u2013 Run solo or race your friends online for the best time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct Boss Encounters \u2013 Avoid deadly bosses that disrupt movement mid-run, each tied to unique map mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed-Focused Design \u2013 Timer-based gameplay and online leaderboards challenge you to master every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized Worlds \u2013 Dive into a series of surreal, atmospheric environments, each with its own visual identity and flow. </p>",
